            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h3>Annotation</h3><table class=\"hl7__eu__lab__report\"><tr><th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us</th></tr><tr><td>The patient’s CD3+CD4+ (T4 helper) cell count is slightly below the normal range, which may indicate mild immunosuppression. This finding should be interpreted in the clinical context, and if clinically indicated, further evaluation or repeat testing may be warranted to assess for underlying causes such as infection, autoimmune disease, or immunodeficiency.</td></tr></table></div>"
